    "title": "NYC Attorney Explains Why 4 Judges Voted to Keep Trump's Civil Fraud Case Alive - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elizabeth Stauffer ,\n9 days ago If ever there was a case of “show me the man, and I’ll find you the crime,” it was New York Attorney General Letitia James’s civil fraud case against President Donald Trump. James made it clear during her 2018 campaign that she would use the law to take down Trump. “This illegitimate president [Trump] — I look forward to going into the office of the attorney general every day, suing him, and then going home,” she said. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
